### 创建高风险审核单
POST http://localhost:8083/internal/risk-audits
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":21,"name":"违禁商品","description":"测试"}

### 查询待审记录
GET http://localhost:8083/api/admin/risk-audits?status=PENDING
X-Admin-Id: 99

### 驳回（将 1 替换为实际审核单 id）
POST http://localhost:8083/api/admin/risk-audits/1/decision
X-Admin-Id: 99
Content-Type: application/json

{"approved":false,"reason":"命中违禁词"}
